= Industrial policy

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Industry and Trade can prepare the credit instrument or run one package of public orders. It can also act on a recorded plant of industry or a railway workshop: rescue it by a conditional credit, take it under public control, or give its workers a representation once it is public. No intervention causes no arbitrary bankruptcy.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

[+ pl_gc_plants +]

- @credit
- @rescue
- @orders
- @public_control
- @worker_representation
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@credit
title: Conditional credit for the market
subtitle: Prepares the credit instrument (public fund): the credit target rises while it works (+5).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'credit').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_industrial_policy_credit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'credit');
!}
go-to: result

@rescue
title: Conditional credit to rescue a named plant
subtitle: Prepares the rescue of the oldest recorded plant that lost capacity: costs the budget 2 units a month for two months, then 1 unit; restores its capacity. Launched from the agenda.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'rescue').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_industrial_policy_rescue_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'rescue');
!}
go-to: result

@orders
title: Public orders
subtitle: One contract for three settlements: costs the budget 1 unit a month; output grows (+0.30 percentage points × execution).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'orders').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_industrial_policy_orders_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'orders');
!}
go-to: result

@public_control
title: Take an enterprise under public control
subtitle: An act of public control of the oldest recorded private plant, voted now; business pressure grows when it takes effect (+15). A public board manages it.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'public_control').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_industrial_policy_public_control_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'public_control');
!}
go-to: result

@worker_representation
title: Workers’ representation in an enterprise
subtitle: Consultation or co-decision in a public plant; the representative is the branch's union, not PPS.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'worker_representation').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_industrial_policy_worker_representation_why +]
go-to: representation_menu

@representation_menu
new-page: true

= Workers' representation

The representation of the workers of a public plant uses one record. Consultation informs them and hears them before any change of their conditions, without a veto. Co-decision needs their consent to mass dismissals and to changes of the wage rules; it needs its own law. Moving from consultation to co-decision gives only the missing relief.

- @rep_consultative
- @rep_decision_rights
- @polish_gov_industry: Back to the card.

@rep_consultative
title: Information and consultation
subtitle: This month's action, nothing from the budget, by the act of the public owner; the workers' grievance falls (−2).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'worker_representation', {variant: 'consultative'}).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_rep_consultative_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'worker_representation', {variant: 'consultative'});
!}
go-to: result

@rep_decision_rights
title: Co-decision on mass dismissals and the wage rules
subtitle: Prepared now (this month's action); its law and launch in the agenda (another month's action), then costs the budget 1 unit a month for two months; grievance falls (−4, or the missing −2 after consultation).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'worker_representation', {variant: 'decision_rights'}).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_rep_decision_rights_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'industrial_policy', 'worker_representation', {variant: 'decision_rights'});
!}
go-to: result

